---
## Secrets. Copy to vault.yml (gitignored), fill in, then encrypt:
##   make vault-encrypt
## Hashes are bcrypt, generate with `make hash` (the password is not stored).

## WGDashboard login password (user = admin_user)
vault_wgdashboard_pass_hash: "CHANGE_ME"

## AdGuard Home login password (user = admin_user). Needed only with awg_local_dns: true
vault_adguardhome_pass_hash: "CHANGE_ME"
